===== Notes =====

Note #1:
SamKnows Whitebox 8's bootloader keeps track of failed boots by incrementing U-Boot environment variable ''bootcount''. If ''bootcount'' reaches 3, U-Boot boots from the recovery partition. The patch takes care of this behavior with the script ''/etc/init.d/bootcount'' (''START=99'') which resets ''bootcount'' to 0 on each completed boot.

Note #2:
The MT7602EN reports itself as ''0x14c3:0x7612'' which is not listed in the upstream mt76 driver. The patch takes care of this by patching the OpenWrt mt76 makefile in ''package/kernel/mt76/patches/000-mt7612.patch''.

Note #3:
WiFi transmit power is correctly calibrated and has decent range and stability. However, speed remains to be tested. Bear in mind that SamKnows never intended for these Whiteboxes to be used as APs (they only use monitor mode). YMMV.

